        /// <summary>
        ///  LZ4F_compressUpdate() :
        ///   LZ4F_compressUpdate() can be called repetitively to compress as much data as necessary.
        ///   Success is guaranteed when dstCapacity &gt;= LZ4F_compressBound(srcSize, prefsPtr).
